</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment for change in valuation of SDR holdings and allocations 1</td><td>93,175</td><td>292,623</td></tr><tr><td>Interest (+) or net charges (-) on:</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>SDRs</td><td>19,834</td><td>69,111</td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Government securities</td><td>28,762</td><td>97,151</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign exchange</td><td>66,618</td><td>206,412</td></tr><tr><td>Commissions</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Income from operations</td><td>606,102</td><td>2,174,820</td></tr><tr><td>Net income (+) or loss (-)</td><td>606,102</td><td>2,174,820</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [146, 1183, 812, 1280], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"1 Beginning July 1974, the International Monetary Fund adopted a technique for valuing the SDRs based on a weighted average of exchange rates for the currencies of selected member countries. The U.S. SDR holdings and allocations are valued on this basis beginning July 1974.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1183, 1474, 1313], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014 Annual balance sheets for fiscal 1934 through 1940 appeared in the 1940 \\\"Annual Report of the Secretary of the Treasury\\\" and those for succeeding years appeared in subsequent reports through 1980. Quarterly balance sheets beginning with December 31, 1938, have been published in the \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\" Data from inception to September 30, 1978, may be found on the statements published in the January 1979 \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1058, 179, 1486, 462], \"page_id\": 114}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1441, 97, 1490, 125], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"115\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [548, 210, 1078, 250], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Trust Funds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 269, 798, 453], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"The tables and charts in this section present the most recent data available on various trust funds administered by the Treasury. Trust funds are moneys held by the Government in accounts established by law or by trust agreement for specific purposes and designated by law as being trust funds.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 460, 798, 521], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"This report compiles data from many sources and provides information in a consolidated manner.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 530, 798, 776], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"The Civil Service Retirement and Disability Fund is operated by the Office of Personnel Management. The Federal Hospital Insurance and Federal Supplementary Medical Insurance Trust Funds are under the auspices of the Department of Health and Human Services' Health Care Financing Administration. The Federal Old-age and Survivors Insurance and Federal Disability Insurance Trust Funds are administered by Social Security.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 269, 1490, 422], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"In addition, the Department of Veterans Affairs' Veterans Benefits Administration disburses the National Service Life Insurance Fund. The Department of Labor's Employment and Training Administration is responsible for the Unemployment Trust Fund.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 429, 1488, 523], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"Data for the Railroad Retirement Trust Fund also are included in this section. That trust fund is administered by the Railroad Retirement Board, an independent agency.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [829, 530, 1492, 745], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"The following tables are published in the December issue of the \\u201cTreasury Bulletin\\u201d each year. Most of the data for the tables came from the \\u201cMonthly Treasury Statement of Receipts and Outlays of the United States Government,\\u201d in which monthly data are published. Estimated figures are based on the \\u201cBudget of the United States Government, Fiscal Year 2004,\\u201d released February 3, 2003.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [439, 830, 1193, 877], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"CHART TF-A.\\u2014Major Trust Funds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [490, 882, 1138, 917], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"Total Net Increase or Decrease in Assets\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [291, 962, 1339, 1803], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [650, 1912, 1029, 1940], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"Source: Financial Management Service\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 87, 197, 127], \"page_id\": 116}], \"content\": \"116\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [714, 87, 920, 130], \"page_id\": 116}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [257, 191, 1382, 255], \"page_id\": 116}], \"content\": \"CHART TF-B.\\u2014Total Receipts of Major Trust Funds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [280, 316, 1379, 1553], \"page_id\": 116}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox