d\": 115}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014 Annual balance sheets for fiscal years 1934 through 1940 appeared in the 1940 \\\"Annual Report of the Secretary of the Treasury\\\" and those for succeeding years appeared in subsequent reports through 1980. Quarterly balance sheets beginning with December 31, 1938, have been published in the \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\" Data from inception to September 30, 1978, may be found on the statements published in the January 1979 \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1331, 1989, 1494, 2018], \"page_id\": 115}], \"content\": \"December 2008\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1049, 182, 1506, 410], \"page_id\": 116}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1342, 427, 1486, 474], \"page_id\": 116}], \"content\": \"Trust Funds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [719, 94, 918, 130], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1437, 90, 1490, 132], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"113\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [541, 189, 1095, 233], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-6A.\\u2014Highway Trust Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 245, 803, 434], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"The following information is released according to the provisions of the Byrd Amendment [codified at 26 United States Code 9503(d)] and represents data concerning the Highway Trust Fund. The figure described as \\\"unfunded authorizations\\\" is the latest estimate received from the DOT for fiscal year 2009.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 248, 1494, 431], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"The 48-month revenue estimates for the highway and mass transit accounts, respectively, include the latest estimates received from Treasury's Office of Tax Analysis for excise taxes, net of refunds. They represent net highway receipts for those periods beginning at the close of fiscal year 2009.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [683, 512, 944, 554], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"Highway Account\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [690, 559, 944, 589], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"(In billions of dollars. Source: DOT)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [148, 599, 1492, 945], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Commitments (unobligated balances plus unpaid obligations, fiscal year 2009)</td><td>79.1</td></tr><tr><td>less:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Cash balance (fiscal year 2009)</td><td>-3.1</td></tr><tr><td>Unfunded authorizations (fiscal year 2009)</td><td>82.2</td></tr><tr><td>48-month revenue estimate (fiscal years 2010, 2011, 2012, and 2013)</td><td>137.8</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 957, 517, 988], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Detail may not add to totals due to rounding.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [658, 1037, 974, 1080], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"Mass Transit Account\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [688, 1091, 949, 1115], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"[In billions of dollars. Source: DOT]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [153, 1124, 1497, 1480], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Commitments (unobligated balances plus unpaid obligations, fiscal year 2009)<